{"unit_id":4,"stage_id":4,"lesson":{"lesson_id":9,"lesson_key":"S4L9","stage_id":4,"title":"Zameer-e-Munfasil Mu'annas Ghaib: فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Zameer-e-Munfasil Mu'annas Ghaib: فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","en":"3rd Person Fem. Singular Detached Pronoun (She / It): فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","ur":"ضمیرِ منفصل مؤنث غائب: فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","hi":"ज़मीर-ए-मुन्फ़सिल मुअन्नस ग़ायब: فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ"},"arabic_Focus":"فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","hinglish_Focus":"Aazmaish → Woh (mu'annas) ek aazmaish hai","page_numbers":"23","book_page":23,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","hinglish":"Aazmaish → Woh (mu'annas) ek aazmaish hai","arabic_word":"فِتْنَةٌ","arabic_combined":"فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","hinglish_word":"Aazmaish","hinglish_combined":"Aazmaish → Woh (mu'annas) ek aazmaish hai","title_en":"Zameer-e-Munfasil Mu'annas Ghaib: فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","subtitle":"Unit 4 • Lesson 9 (Book Page 23)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"فِتْنَةٌ","after_ar":"هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","before_hi":"Aazmaish","after_hi":"Woh (mu'annas) ek aazmaish hai"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S4L9 — Zameer-e-Munfasil Mu'annas Ghaib: فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S4L9 — Zameer-e-Munfasil Mu'annas Ghaib: فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qism / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["هِيَ + Mu'annas Ism","هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ / هِيَ بَيْضَاءُ","Woh ek aazmaish hai / Woh (haath) roshan sufaid hai"],["وَهِيَ / فَهِيَ","وَهِيَ خَاوِيَةٌ / فَهِيَ كَالْحِجَارَةِ","Halanke woh giri hui thi / Toh woh pattharon ki tarah hain"],["هِيَ + الْـ (Hasr)","هِيَ الْحَيَوَانُ / هِيَ الْمَأْوَىٰ","Wohi asal zindagi hai / Wohi thikana hai"]]}},{"id":"sec_s4l9_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u4grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 9</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer-e-Munfasil Mu'annas Ghaib: فِتْنَةٌ ← هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ (Page 23)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">فِتْنَةٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer (هِيَ)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• فِتْنَةٌ (Aazmaish) se هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ (Woh (mu'annas) ek aazmaish hai) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 23):** Mu'annas ism (Jaise `فِتْنَةٌ`، `آيَةٌ`، `الْقَرْيَةُ`، `النَّارُ`، `السَّاعَةُ`) ke liye `هُوَ` ke bajaye **`هِيَ`** ('Woh') istemal hota hai: `فَإِنَّمَا هِيَ زَجْرَةٌ وَاحِدَةٌ` (Pas woh toh sirf ek hi daant/chikha hai), `وَإِنَّ الدَّارَ الْآخِرَةَ لَهِيَ الْحَيَوَانُ` (Aur beshak aakhirat ka ghar hi asal zindagi hai)."}},{"id":"sec_s4l9_g1","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s4l9_g1_w1","arabic":"هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِتْنَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Woh aazmaish hai","translations":{"en":"It is a trial","ur":"وہ آزمائش ہے","hi":"वह आज़माइश है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w2","arabic":"هِيَ ظَالِمَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ظَالِمَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Woh zalim hai","translations":{"en":"It is unjust","ur":"وہ ظالم ہے","hi":"वह ज़ालिम है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w3","arabic":"هِيَ أَكْبَرُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَكْبَرُ</span>","hinglish":"Woh sab se badi hai","translations":{"en":"It is greater","ur":"وہ سب سے بڑی ہے","hi":"वह सबसे बड़ी है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w4","arabic":"هِيَ زَجْرَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">زَجْرَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Woh cheekh hai","translations":{"en":"It is a shout","ur":"وہ ایک چیخ ہے","hi":"वह एक चीख़ है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w5","arabic":"هِيَ بَيْضَاءُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَيْضَاءُ</span>","hinglish":"Woh safaid hai","translations":{"en":"It is white","ur":"وہ سفید ہے","hi":"वह सफ़ेद है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w6","arabic":"هِيَ أَشَدُّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَشَدُّ</span>","hinglish":"Woh zyada sakht hai","translations":{"en":"It is more severe","ur":"وہ زیادہ سخت ہے","hi":"वह ज़्यादा सख़्त है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w7","arabic":"هِيَ خَاوِيَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَاوِيَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Woh giri hui hai","translations":{"en":"It is in ruins","ur":"وہ گری ہوئی ہے","hi":"वह गिरी हुई है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w8","arabic":"هِيَ شَاخِصَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَاخِصَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Woh pathrayi hui hai","translations":{"en":"They are staring","ur":"وہ پتھرائی ہوئی ہیں","hi":"वह पथराई हुई हैं"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w9","arabic":"هِيَ أَقْوَمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَقْوَمُ</span>","hinglish":"Woh zyada seedhi hai","translations":{"en":"It is most upright","ur":"وہ سب سے زیادہ سیدھی ہے","hi":"वह सबसे ज़्यादा सीधी है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w10","arabic":"هِيَ حَيَّةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">حَيَّةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Woh saanp hai","translations":{"en":"It is a snake","ur":"وہ ایک سانپ ہے","hi":"वह एक साँप है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w11","arabic":"هِيَ ثُعْبَانٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ثُعْبَانٌ</span>","hinglish":"Woh ajdaha hai","translations":{"en":"It is a serpent","ur":"وہ ایک اژدہا ہے","hi":"वह एक अजदहा है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w12","arabic":"هِيَ أَحْسَنُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَحْسَنُ</span>","hinglish":"Woh zyada behtar hai","translations":{"en":"It is better","ur":"وہ زیادہ بہتر ہے","hi":"वह ज़्यादा बेहतर है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w13","arabic":"هِيَ مَوَاقِيتُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَوَاقِيتُ</span>","hinglish":"Woh waqt janne ke zarai hain","translations":{"en":"They are indicators of periods","ur":"وہ وقت جاننے کے ذرائع ہیں","hi":"वह वक़्त जानने के ज़राए हैं"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w14","arabic":"هِيَ دَارُ الْقَرَارِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">دَارُ الْقَرَارِ</span>","hinglish":"Woh hamesha rehne ka ghar hai","translations":{"en":"It is the home of permanent settlement","ur":"وہ ہمیشہ رہنے کا گھر ہے","hi":"वह हमेशा रहने का घर है"},"ref":"40:39"},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w15","arabic":"وَهِيَ ظَالِمَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ظَالِمَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur woh zalim hai","translations":{"en":"And it is unjust","ur":"اور وہ ظالم ہے","hi":"और वह ज़ालिम है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w16","arabic":"سَلَامٌ هِيَ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سَلَامٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span>","hinglish":"Salamti hai woh","translations":{"en":"Peace it is","ur":"سلامتی ہے وہ","hi":"सलामती है वह"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w17","arabic":"وَهِيَ دُخَانٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">دُخَانٌ</span>","hinglish":"Aur woh dhuan hai","translations":{"en":"While it was smoke","ur":"اور وہ دھواں تھا (ہے)","hi":"और वह धुआँ है"}},{"id":"s4l9_g1_w18","arabic":"بَلْ هِيَ فِتْنَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">بَلْ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِتْنَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Balke woh aazmaish hai","translations":{"en":"Rather, it is a trial","ur":"بلکہ وہ آزمائش ہے","hi":"बल्कि वह आज़माइश है"},"ref":"39:49"}],"cols":3}},{"id":"sec_s4l9_s2","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s4l9_s2_s1","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"فَإِنَّمَا هِيَ زَجْرَةٌ وَاحِدَةٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّمَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">زَجْرَةٌ وَاحِدَةٌ</span>","hinglish":"Toh sirf woh ek cheekh hai","translations":{"en":"It will only be a single shout","ur":"پس وہ صرف ایک ہی چیخ ہوگی","hi":"तो सिर्फ़ वह एक चीख़ है"},"ref":"37:19"},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s2","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"هِيَ مَوَاقِيتُ لِلنَّاسِ وَالْحَجِّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَوَاقِيتُ لِلنَّاسِ وَالْحَجِّ</span>","hinglish":"Woh waqt janne ke zarai hain logon ke liye aur Hajj ke liye","translations":{"en":"They are indicators of periods for the people and for Hajj","ur":"وہ وقت جاننے کے ذرائع ہیں لوگوں کے لیے اور حج کے لیے","hi":"वह वक़्त जानने के ज़राए हैं लोगों के लिए और हज के लिए"},"ref":"2:189"},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s3","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"وَإِنَّ الْآخِرَةَ / هِيَ دَارُ الْقَرَارِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِنَّ الْآخِرَةَ /</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">دَارُ الْقَرَارِ</span>","hinglish":"Aur beshak aakhirat woh hamesha rehne ka ghar hai","translations":{"en":"And indeed, the Hereafter is the home of permanent settlement","ur":"اور بیشک آخرت ہی ہمیشہ رہنے کا گھر ہے","hi":"और बेशक आख़िरत वह हमेशा रहने का घर है"},"ref":"40:39"},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s4","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"سَلَامٌ هِيَ / حَتَّى مَطْلَعِ الْفَجْرِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">سَلَامٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">/ حَتَّى مَطْلَعِ الْفَجْرِ</span>","hinglish":"Salamti hai woh fajar tuloo hone tak","translations":{"en":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn","ur":"سلامتی ہے وہ فجر کے طلوع ہونے تک","hi":"सलामती है वह फ़ज्र तुलू होने तक"},"ref":"97:5"},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s5","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"هِيَ الْمَأْوَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مَأْوَى</span>","hinglish":"Woh hi thikana hai","translations":{"en":"That is the refuge","ur":"وہی ٹھکانا ہے","hi":"वही ठिकाना है"}},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s6","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"هِيَ الْعُلْيَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عُلْيَا</span>","hinglish":"Woh hi buland hai","translations":{"en":"That is the highest","ur":"وہی سب سے بلند ہے","hi":"वही बुलंद है"},"ref":"9:40"},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s7","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"هِيَ الْحَيَوَانُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حَيَوَانُ</span>","hinglish":"Woh hi zindagi hai","translations":{"en":"That is the true life","ur":"وہی اصل زندگی ہے","hi":"वही (असल) ज़िंदगी है"}},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s8","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ الْجَحِيمَ / هِيَ الْمَأْوَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ الْجَحِيمَ /</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مَأْوَى</span>","hinglish":"Toh beshak jahannam woh hi thikana hai","translations":{"en":"Then indeed, Hellfire will be the refuge","ur":"تو بیشک جہنم ہی ٹھکانا ہے","hi":"तो बेशक जहन्नम वही ठिकाना है"},"ref":"79:39"},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s9","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"فَإِنَّ الْجَنَّةَ / هِيَ الْمَأْوَى","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَإِنَّ الْجَنَّةَ /</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">مَأْوَى</span>","hinglish":"Toh beshak jannat woh hi thikana hai","translations":{"en":"Then indeed, Paradise will be the refuge","ur":"تو بیشک جنت ہی ٹھکانا ہے","hi":"तो बेशक जन्नत वही ठिकाना है"},"ref":"79:41"},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s10","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"وَكَلِمَةُ اللَّهِ / هِيَ الْعُلْيَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَكَلِمَةُ اللَّهِ /</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هِيَ الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">عُلْيَا</span>","hinglish":"Aur Allah ka kalima woh hi buland hai","translations":{"en":"And the word of Allah is the highest","ur":"اور اللہ کا کلمہ ہی سب سے بلند ہے","hi":"और अल्लाह का कलिमा वही बुलंद है"},"ref":"9:40"},{"id":"s4l9_s2_s11","sentence_number":11,"arabic":"وَإِنَّ الدَّارَ الْآخِرَةَ لَهِيَ الْحَيَوَانُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَإِنَّ الدَّارَ الْآخِرَةَ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَهِيَ الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">حَيَوَانُ</span>","hinglish":"Aur beshak aakhirat ka ghar yakinan woh hi zindagi hai","translations":{"en":"And indeed, the home of the Hereafter - that is the true life","ur":"اور بیشک آخرت کا گھر، یقیناً وہی اصل زندگی ہے","hi":"और बेशक आख़िरत का घर यक़ीनन वही ज़िंदगी है"},"ref":"29:64"}]}}]}}